<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Surgical.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Surgical.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Eli Kammerman reiterated his strong buy rating on U.S. Surgical Corp.</p>
<p>-- Said company's first quarter earnings of $0.39 a share beat his forecast by $0.03.</p>
<p>-- Maintained $1.70 per share forecast for 1997 and $2.10 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Clear benefits from the sales ramp-up of new products are now visible, Kammerman said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Has one-year price target of $50-$52 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares were not immediately trading after closing Thursday at 32-3/8.</p>
</text>
